            "reviewBody": "The whole family LOVED this recipe. The best halibut since our visit to Alaska a couple of years ago. There was a lot of extra flour mixture left over. Next time I will use half the flour and spices, as it didn't take much to coat 1 lb of halibut. Cooking time was just right, don't expect the fish to brown as much as the photo though.",
